description "Vandar Tokare

A wise old master who specializes in dampening enemy Force usage.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster RoF
- Lightsaber (Dual)
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense (2)
-- Blaster Deflect (2)
-- 27% more special damage
-- 25% shorter
-- 26% thinner
-- EX Saber Throw (3) ^3[CS1]
--- 66% more damage
- Force Suppression (Minigun 3)
-- Focuses/poisons on hit
-- Hitscan charges
-- 500% more FP drain
-- 99% less damage
-- 2600% slower RoF

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (1)
- Push (1)
- Pull (1)
- Sense (1)
- Sever (Drain 2) ^3[CS2]
- Mind Trick (1) ^3[CS4]
- Repulse ^3[Melee CS1]
-- Lifts on impact
-- 50% less damage

^8Attributes:
- Dexterity (1)
- Force Block (2)
- Force Focus (1)
- 10% more knockback given
- 10% less knockback taken

^3Abilities:
- Super Repulse (Barge 1) ^3[Melee CS2]"